{
  "caveats": [
    "These are rounded survey estimates, not exact administrative counts, vacancies, wages or employment by industry. Occupation describes the work performed; industry describes the employer’s activity. Armed-forces and unidentified occupations are combined in the source and cannot be separated. Totals overlap their components, and rounding can prevent exact reconciliation. The table has no district or sex breakdown.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
